{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Fetch one complete implementation contract before generating UI. Use this when you need the full rules, CSS, templates, recipes and tokens in one call; the full payload is large (often 30k-60k characters). Pass sections to return only identity/provenance plus the parts you need.\n\nArgs:\n  - slug (string): style identifier.\n  - sections (array, optional): philosophy, aiRules, doList, dontList, colors, globalCss, components, variants, tokens, recipes, readiness, lintRules.\n\nReturns JSON: { schemaVersion: \"stylekit-brief-v1\", slug, name, nameEn, category, styleType, description, tags, keywords, provenance, origin, fallbackReason?, sections?, plus the selected sections }. provenance.source records the content publisher (bundled, static, or community) and is distinct from transport origin. Coverage guidance does not certify visual quality or accessibility.\n\nExamples:\n  - \"build a landing page in glassmorphism\" -> slug: \"glassmorphism\"; keep the returned stylekit-brief-v1 payload for later validation.\n  - \"just give me the rules and tokens\" -> slug: \"glassmorphism\", sections: [\"aiRules\", \"tokens\", \"lintRules\"].","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"sections":{"description":"Return only these sections plus identity and provenance; omit for the full brief","items":{"enum":["philosophy","aiRules","doList","dontList","colors","globalCss","components","variants","tokens","recipes","readiness","lintRules"],"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"slug":{"description":"Style slug","maxLength":100,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["slug"],"type":"object"},"name":"stylekit_get_implementation_brief","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"aiRules":{"type":"string"},"category":{"type":"string"},"color